1
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,430
Jiang Yu.

2
00:00:51,910 --> 00:00:54,230
We are in the same boat now.

3
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,580
Can't fall asleep?

4
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:09,310
What's wrong?

5
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:12,789
Nothing.

6
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:19,450
Just checking in on how
my partner is sleeping.

7
00:01:28,230 --> 00:01:30,030
This bed is really comfortable.

8
00:01:30,570 --> 00:01:33,570
Aren't you going to
invite me up, Miss Wen?

9
00:01:40,870 --> 00:01:41,930
Then, you want me to

10
00:01:42,570 --> 00:01:43,570
sleep on the sofa?

11
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:49,950
Don't worry.

12
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,759
I won't get into your bed.

13
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,240
Don't do this.

14
00:02:11,009 --> 00:02:12,540
I won't be able to hold back.

15
00:02:39,930 --> 00:02:41,760
[Dearest Episode 10]

16
00:03:10,130 --> 00:03:13,700
♪ Slow embrace in the silent dark ♪

17
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:17,200
♪ Forbidden but it feels so right ♪

18
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:20,550
♪ You and me, just this one night ♪

19
00:03:20,579 --> 00:03:24,930
♪ Under the faint moonlight ♪

20
00:03:24,950 --> 00:03:28,370
♪ Slowly dancing, no words to say ♪

21
00:03:28,390 --> 00:03:31,670
♪ Closer till we fade away ♪

22
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:35,410
♪ Taboo love in the quiet air ♪

23
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:41,410
♪ I don't care, I want you there ♪

24
00:03:42,980 --> 00:03:46,010
♪ They can't know what we've begun ♪

25
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:49,170
♪ Quiet like the setting sun ♪

26
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:52,270
♪ Skin to skin, we don't make a sound ♪

27
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:56,620
♪ Lost inside the hidden round ♪

28
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,980
♪ We're walking on a thin, thin line ♪

29
00:04:00,010 --> 00:04:03,460
♪ But I don't wanna stop this time ♪

30
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:07,470
♪ We shouldn't stay, but we don't leave ♪

31
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:10,630
♪ This quiet chemistry ♪

32
00:04:10,660 --> 00:04:13,800
♪ Soft and slow, we cross the line ♪

33
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:16,959
♪ Just one more time ♪

34
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:20,519
♪ Slow embrace in the silent dark ♪

35
00:04:19,829 --> 00:04:21,310
Get ready. It's time to go.

36
00:04:20,810 --> 00:04:24,160
♪ Forbidden but it feels so right ♪

37
00:04:24,180 --> 00:04:27,220
♪ You and me, just this one night ♪

38
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:31,820
♪ Under the faint moonlight ♪

39
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:35,430
♪ Slowly dancing, no words to say ♪

40
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,430
Why are you blushing?

41
00:04:35,460 --> 00:04:38,890
♪ Closer till we fade away ♪

42
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:42,530
♪ Taboo love in the quiet air ♪

43
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,360
Hurry up.

44
00:04:42,590 --> 00:04:47,880
♪ I don't care, I want you there ♪

45
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:50,150
♪ Maybe it's a sin to stay ♪

46
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:53,320
♪ But I'd lost my soul this way ♪

47
00:04:53,470 --> 00:04:56,990
♪ Just your warmth against my own ♪

48
00:04:57,070 --> 00:05:01,510
♪ I don't wanna go home ♪

49
00:05:21,870 --> 00:05:24,130
After it's done, the fee will be doubled.

50
00:05:24,150 --> 00:05:25,280
Don't worry, Mr. He.

51
00:05:25,970 --> 00:05:29,770
I always do things
without leaving a trace.

52
00:05:39,050 --> 00:05:41,310
You were indeed cuter when you were a kid.

53
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,670
It's just a fake wedding.

54
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:46,350
Do we need to pick these photos
for the VCR?

55
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,870
It's necessary.

56
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:49,690
If we don't take a look,

57
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,090
what if we get exposed?

58
00:05:56,870 --> 00:05:58,040
Then, Mr. Jiang,

59
00:05:59,310 --> 00:06:01,480
How long are you going to
take to pick the photos?

60
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:05,070
Are you going to look through
all these photos?

61
00:06:06,750 --> 00:06:07,560
Of course.

62
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,500
But when you were a kid,

63
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:17,400
why did you always hold this doll?

64
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:26,030
That was a sleep-aid doll Wen Xin gave me.

65
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:29,360
When she still acted like a mother,

66
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:33,430
she used to coax me to sleep
with this doll.

67
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:36,950
So, later, without this doll,

68
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:39,110
I couldn't even fall asleep.

69
00:06:49,670 --> 00:06:50,670
Then, where is

70
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,750
this doll now?

71
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:03,250
She cut it up when she was drunk
and out of control.

72
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,710
After that,

73
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,390
I never slept well.

74
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,310
It doesn't matter.

75
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,400
These photos are not important.

76
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:14,920
But you,

77
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:18,830
why don't you let me see your album?

78
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:23,430
Could it be that
there are photos of your old love?

79
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,340
You think too much.

80
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:27,070
In all my life,

81
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,650
I've only loved one person,

82
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,320
and we're not even together.

83
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,720
Why?

84
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:37,680
You are the boss of Cloudsea.

85
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,040
Why don't you go find her?

86
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:44,430
Even if she's with someone else,

87
00:07:44,470 --> 00:07:46,340
you can take her by force,

88
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:48,490
force her back to your side,

89
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,530
and let love grow over time.

90
00:07:51,250 --> 00:07:52,780
If you really love someone,

91
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:56,070
you don't have to
ask the one to love you.

92
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:57,680
But I will be prepared.

93
00:07:58,290 --> 00:07:59,590
When I meet her again,

94
00:07:59,610 --> 00:08:01,850
I will give her money, power, status,

95
00:08:02,090 --> 00:08:03,550
and everything she wants.

96
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,950
That's really touching.

97
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:16,830
I'm sorry for putting you through
this fake wedding.

98
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,160
I'll go prepare first.

99
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:19,440
Take your time to pack.

100
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,730
This is our route to the wedding venue.

101
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,870
He Mu plans to create an explosion

102
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:43,720
at this curve we must pass

103
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:45,400
to reach the wedding venue.

104
00:08:48,590 --> 00:08:49,620
Mr. Alex,

105
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:52,840
I've already dealt with He Mu for you.

106
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,870
Then, the business you promised me...

107
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:57,360
Don't worry.

108
00:08:58,220 --> 00:08:59,920
As long as you cooperate with me,

109
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:02,190
this casino is yours.

110
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:05,930
Akun has already given me
all the information

111
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,970
about their transactions.

112
00:09:06,970 --> 00:09:08,710
The driver has also been
replaced by our man.

113
00:09:08,710 --> 00:09:11,070
So, when we get to this curve,

114
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:13,710
there will be two identical cars here.

115
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:15,150
You transfer to this car

116
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:17,180
and go safely to the wedding venue.

117
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:25,130
What about you?

118
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,960
I'll wait at the crime scene in advance

119
00:09:28,150 --> 00:09:31,210
and let the reporters
photograph me coming out of there

120
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,040
when the explosion happens.

121
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,670
Then, at the wedding,

122
00:09:37,030 --> 00:09:38,480
in front of all the guests,

123
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,340
I'll live-stream the explosion.

124
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,120
And I'll announce

125
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,650
all the evidence of
He Mu's murder-for-hire.

126
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,770
This is not just a simple

127
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:47,400
live-streamed murder case.

128
00:09:47,630 --> 00:09:49,440
It's also a family tragedy caused by
the Wen family's live-in son-in-law,

129
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,840
who let his son approach

130
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,300
the Wen family's daughter

131
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,800
and then kill her

132
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:56,150
to seize power.

133
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,720
Grandpa hates the one
who tries to seize power the most.

134
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:05,150
Even if he wants to clear his name,

135
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:07,670
Grandpa won't let him succeed.

136
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,960
He will eventually lose everything

137
00:10:10,770 --> 00:10:12,370
and never be able to make a comeback.
